# Test configuration for thorn MCNuX
#
# specs/verification-suite-design.md [MCNX-VER-01]: every MCNuX verification
# benchmark runs single-rank — that is the exact-reproducibility mode of
# specs/rng-and-statistical-acceptance.md, and it is what makes the golden
# TSV/norm data bit-reproducible.
#
# No per-test TEST block: every benchmark here is diffed at the flesh
# harness defaults ABSTOL = RELTOL = 1e-12. A loosened tolerance is admissible
# only as a TEST block carrying an in-file justification (the
# CarpetX/TestODESolvers/test/test.ccl precedent) — do not add one without it.
#
# `.tsv` is recognized as golden data through CarpetX's global
# `EXTENSIONS tsv` declaration (CarpetX/CarpetX/test/test.ccl), which applies
# to every thorn in the pinned ThornList, so it is not repeated here.

NPROCS 1
